    "description": "Class III, mains or battery-powered, self-indicating non-automatic weighing instrument designed to record the weight of a baby; shall not be used for direct sales to the public. LCD display fitted into load receptor: 5 digits, with Zero, Net and Hold indicators. Three buttons (Tare, Hold, On/Off/Zero). Aluminium base enclosure containing the load cell and electronics. Plastic load receptor with tray for baby weighing. Level indicator next to the display. Four adjustable feet for levelling. Sealed by tamper-evident label over a base-plate screw (preventing opening of the housing) and over the access hole of the calibration service button."
